Manifest.toml
# GUI/ is an application, not a library - its Manifest.toml should stay committed so
# everyone who runs it gets the exact dependency versions it was tested with.
!GUI/Manifest.toml
.DS_Store
*.pdf
*.png
*.gif
# The blanket rules above are for scratch/generated output (figures/ and similar) - real
# documentation assets under docs/src/assets/ need to stay trackable regardless of extension.
!docs/src/assets/**/*.pdf
!docs/src/assets/**/*.png
!docs/src/assets/**/*.gif
figures/
settings.json
examples/B3.jl
test/test_B3.jl